13S:
- direct-lineup contextual PMF
- direct-lineup training dataset
- direct-lineup challenger
- direct-lineup feature-list checks
- direct-lineup sensitivity checks
- validation gates
- no-leakage checks
- promote only if allow_promote=true and no_promote=false and all gates pass

